        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Aira, Rinka and Yuri merge fruit and unlock new cards in this sweet and charming Suika x Deckbuilder!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merge Fruit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge fruit of increasing size to win the game! Try to get the biggest fruit as possible. Look out for the stars to complete the stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/0266afee3fefd4abba23aabd195cef71.poster.avif?t=1779304837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/0266afee3fefd4abba23aabd195cef71.webm?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/0266afee3fefd4abba23aabd195cef71.mp4?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't let the cabinet overflow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities and smart merging to avoid overflowing the arcade cabinet!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/433cecaf0dbddd5e92683628f2c4df53.poster.avif?t=1779304837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/433cecaf0dbddd5e92683628f2c4df53.webm?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/433cecaf0dbddd5e92683628f2c4df53.mp4?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make friends </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the girls of the arcade, learn their stories and unlock unique endings. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/46a5458528dd3e1c38547f9d7aef8e44.poster.avif?t=1779304837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/46a5458528dd3e1c38547f9d7aef8e44.webm?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/46a5458528dd3e1c38547f9d7aef8e44.mp4?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards, abilities and items to build stronger decks and synergies! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/c40ed295e80d2f57d0839179b9d8534e.poster.avif?t=1779304837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/c40ed295e80d2f57d0839179b9d8534e.webm?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219340/extras/c40ed295e80d2f57d0839179b9d8534e.mp4?t=1779304837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
